Lani

Two points

- print the contents of 'cutpts', it does not contain the values you think it does

- if you are using the package Distance, then use the function ds() rather than ddf.  The function ds() relieves you of specifying the method, dsmodel, meta.data arguments to ddf().  Instead, you can fit the model you desire with:

abund.hn.cov <- ds(data=abund.cov.fixed, transect="point", truncation=110, cutpoints=cutpts, key="hn")

